---
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---

<Section id="about" num="00" title="About">
  <div class="about">
    <p class="lede">
      Senior engineer and scientist. Nearly two decades researching, designing, formalizing,
      prototyping, implementing, and maintaining solutions to complex problems.
    </p>
    <p>
      A computer science generalist: from high-level software, APIs, and theory, down to
      low-level hardware architecture, compilers, and static analysis. Language-agnostic, with
      a specialty in type-driven development, object-oriented, and functional design. Fast and
      eager to learn new languages, techniques, frameworks, and paradigms.
    </p>
    <p>
      Prefers collaborative environments, and puts a premium on being able to contribute to
      open source. Tech lead for teams of two to eight. Communicative to the point of
      “overly&nbsp;so”. Has taught and mentored in a variety of roles.
    </p>
    <p class="about__status mono">
      currently: {profile.availability}.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  .about p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .about__status {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
